    "name": "NotesAPI",
    "description": "## NotesAPI\n\nThe **NotesAPI** collection provides a complete set of RESTful endpoints for managing notes. It covers the full CRUD lifecycle — creating, retrieving, updating, and deleting notes — as well as partial update support.\n\nThe collection is organized into five folders by HTTP method:\n\n- **POSTAPIs** — Create new notes\n    \n- **GETAPIs** — Retrieve existing notes (single or list)\n    \n- **PUTAPIs** — Fully replace/update a note\n    \n- **PATCHAPIs** — Partially update a note's fields\n    \n- **DELETEAPIs** — Remove notes\n    \n\nUse this collection to develop, test, and validate the NotesAPI across all supported operations.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
